Vg Vg 0 AC 1
Rg V1 Vg 1
L1 V1 0 {31/14} Rser=1n
L2 V2 V1 {961/48} Rser=0
L3 V2 0 {31/48} Rser=0
C2 V2 V1 {768/961}
.ac dec 1000 0.0001 1000
.options plotwinsize=0
.save V(Vg) V(V1) V(V2) I(Vg)
.meas AC baja FIND mag(V(V2)/V(Vg)) AT=0.0001
.meas AC alta FIND mag(V(V2)/V(Vg)) AT=1000
.meas AC nulo_re FIND re(V(V2)/V(Vg)) AT={0.25/(2*pi)}
.meas AC nulo_im FIND im(V(V2)/V(Vg)) AT={0.25/(2*pi)}
* Frecuencias AC en Hz: f = omega/(2*pi).
* L1: Rser=1n evita el lazo ideal de inductores en DC.
.backanno
.end
